---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CC0 1.0 Universal (applies to the dataset)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Rootfast dataset (the contents of the Cloudflare D1 database backing
api.rootfast.org, the SQL chunks generated by api/scripts/build_chunks.py,
and any intermediate SQLite files produced by sources/*/etl/) is released
into the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

To the extent possible under law, Rootfast contributors have waived all
copyright and related rights in the dataset worldwide. You may copy, modify,
distribute, and use it, even for commercial purposes, all without asking
permission. See https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/ for the
full text.

We ask — but do not require — that you cite the upstream sources:

  - USDA PLANTS Database — https://plants.usda.gov
  - USDA-ARS Plant Hardiness Zone Map (2023) — https://planthardiness.ars.usda.gov
  - GBIF Backbone Taxonomy — https://www.gbif.org/dataset/d7dddbf4-2cf0-4f39-9b2a-bb099caae36c
  - iNaturalist — https://www.inaturalist.org
